<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Jihoo's Portfolio | 지후의 포트폴리오</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts (Noto Sans KR) -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Noto Sans KR', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            50: '#f0f7ff',
                            100: '#e0effe',
                            500: '#3b82f6',
                            600: '#2563eb',
                            700: '#1d4ed8',
                            900: '#1e3a8a',
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        .glass {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-sans antialiased selection:bg-blue-500 selection:text-white">

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 glass border-b border-slate-200/60 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between h-16">
                <!-- Home Button & Logo -->
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <!-- Home Link Button -->
                    <a href="../index.html" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-700 hover:text-blue-600 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold transition border border-slate-200" title="메인 홈으로 이동">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-house text-blue-600"></i>
                        <span>홈</span>
                    </a>

                    <!-- Logo -->
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl tracking-tight text-slate-900">
                        <a href="#" class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-lg">J</span>
                            <span>JIHOO.PORTFOLIO</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Desktop Navigation -->
                <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-8 text-sm font-medium">
                    <a href="#about" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition">소개 (About)</a>
                    <a href="#projects" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition">주요 보고서 (Projects)</a>
                    <a href="#activities" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition">활동 내역 (Activities)</a>
                    <a href="#contact" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition">연락처 (Contact)</a>
                </nav>

                <!-- Action Button -->
                <div class="hidden md:flex items-center">
                    <a href="#contact" class="bg-slate-900 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide transition duration-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg">
                        문의하기
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Mobile Menu Button -->
                <div class="md:hidden flex items-center">
                    <button id="mobile-menu-btn" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 focus:outline-none p-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bars text-xl"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mobile Menu Dropdown -->
        <div id="mobile-menu" class="hidden md:hidden bg-white border-b border-slate-200 px-4 pt-2 pb-4 space-y-2">
            <a href="../index.html" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-blue-600 font-semibold bg-blue-50">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-house mr-1.5"></i>홈으로 이동
            </a>
            <a href="#about" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-slate-700 font-medium hover:bg-slate-100">소개 (About)</a>
            <a href="#projects" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-slate-700 font-medium hover:bg-slate-100">주요 보고서 (Projects)</a>
            <a href="#activities" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-slate-700 font-medium hover:bg-slate-100">활동 내역 (Activities)</a>
            <a href="#contact" class="block px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-slate-700 font-medium hover:bg-slate-100">연락처 (Contact)</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50/50 to-slate-50">
        <!-- Background Elements -->
        <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-1/3 right-10 w-72 h-72 bg-indigo-200/30 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold mb-6">
                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-600 animate-pulse"></span>
                    <span>데이터 탐구자 & 분석가 지후의 포트폴리오</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
                    데이터 속에서 <br class="hidden sm:inline"/>
                    <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">가치 있는 인사이트</span>를 찾습니다
                </h1>
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed font-normal">
                    공공데이터를 활용한 깊이 있는 분석과 탐구를 진행하고 있습니다.<br class="hidden sm:inline"/>
                    대학 교육 통계부터 도로 교통 안전 데이터까지, 현실 문제를 데이터로 조명합니다.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
                    <a href="#projects" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-medium shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/25 transition duration-300">
                        보고서 살펴보기 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down ml-2 text-xs"></i>
                    </a>
                    <a href="#about" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-white border border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-medium transition duration-300">
                        자기소개 보기
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Section -->
    <section id="about" class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
                <!-- Left: Profile Info -->
                <div class="md:col-span-5 text-center md:text-left">
                    <div class="relative inline-block mb-6">
                        <div class="w-48 h-48 sm:w-56 sm:h-56 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 p-1 shadow-xl mx-auto">
                            <div class="w-full h-full bg-slate-100 rounded-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-slate-400 overflow-hidden">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-astronaut text-6xl text-blue-500 mb-2"></i>
                                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">JIHOO'S PROFILE</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="absolute -bottom-3 -right-3 bg-white p-3 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-slate-100 flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-blue-600 text-xl"></i>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800">Data Enthusiast</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Right: Text Content -->
                <div class="md:col-span-7">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">안녕하세요, 데이터 분석가 지후입니다.</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        복잡한 데이터 집합 속에서 논리적 흐름을 찾아내고, 이를 바탕으로 의미 있는 결론을 도출하는 도전을 즐깁니다. 
                        공공데이터 활용 보고서 작성을 통해 데이터 정제, 시각화, 통계적 분석 역량을 키워왔습니다.
                    </p>

                    <!-- Skill Tags -->
                    <div class="mb-8">
                        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">주요 역량 및 관심 분야</h3>
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                            <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium"><i class="fa-solid fa-database text-blue-500 mr-1.5"></i>공공데이터 분석</span>
                            <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie text-emerald-500 mr-1.5"></i>데이터 시각화</span>
                            <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-amber-500 mr-1.5"></i>진로 탐구</span>
                            <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium"><i class="fa-solid fa-car text-indigo-500 mr-1.5"></i>교통 안전 분석</span>
                            <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines text-purple-500 mr-1.5"></i>보고서 작성</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Quick Stats -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
                        <div>
                            <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600">2+</span>
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">핵심 프로젝트</span>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600">100%</span>
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">공공데이터 활용</span>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600">Insight</span>
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">문제 해결 중심</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Projects Section (Main Reports) -->
    <section id="projects" class="py-20 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200/60">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <!-- Section Header -->
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-xs font-extrabold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Projects & Reports</h2>
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">데이터 분석 보고서</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">
                    공공데이터 포털의 공신력 있는 데이터를 활용하여 작성한 주요 분석 보고서입니다.<br/>
                    각 카드의 자세히 보기 버튼을 클릭하면 해당 웹페이지 보고서로 이동합니다.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Cards Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                
                <!-- Report Card 1: 진로 보고서 -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl border border-slate-200/80 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden group flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <!-- Card Header / Banner -->
                        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-700 p-6 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
                            <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 translate-x-4 -translate-y-4 opacity-10">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-9xl"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 relative z-10">
                                <span class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-medium border border-white/20">
                                    대학알리미 API / DATA
                                </span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-blue-100"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar mr-1"></i>2026.02</span>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 relative z-10 group-hover:text-blue-100 transition">
                                대학알리미 데이터 기반 <br/>진로 탐구 보고서
                            </h4>
                            <p class="text-blue-100 text-xs line-clamp-2 relative z-10">
                                학과별 취업률, 신입생 경쟁률, 등록금 현황 등 공시 데이터를 활용한 데이터 기반 학과 진로 탐구 및 분석.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Card Body -->
                        <div class="p-6">
                            <div class="space-y-3 mb-6">
                                <div class="flex items-start text-xs text-slate-600">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-blue-500 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i>
                                    <span><strong>분석 대상:</strong> 전국 주요 대학 학과별 취업률 및 진학 데이터</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex items-start text-xs text-slate-600">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-blue-500 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i>
                                    <span><strong>주요 인사이트:</strong> 전공 분야별 취업 트렌드 및 지표 분석</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex items-start text-xs text-slate-600">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-blue-500 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i>
                                    <span><strong>활용 도구:</strong> Excel, Chart.js 시각화</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Card Footer Link Button -->
                    <div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-0">
                        <a href="./data1/index.html" class="w-full bg-slate-100 hover:bg-blue-600 text-slate-700 hover:text-white font-medium py-3 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm transition duration-300 flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white">
                            <span>자세히 보기</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-xs"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Report Card 2: 교통데이터분석 보고서 -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl border border-slate-200/80 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden group flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <!-- Card Header / Banner -->
                        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-700 p-6 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
                            <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 translate-x-4 -translate-y-4 opacity-10">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-car text-9xl"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 relative z-10">
                                <span class="bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-medium border border-white/20">
                                    도로교통공단 DATA
                                </span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-emerald-100"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar mr-1"></i>2026.01</span>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 relative z-10 group-hover:text-emerald-100 transition">
                                도로교통공단 데이터 활용 <br/>교통사고 요인 분석 보고서
                            </h4>
                            <p class="text-emerald-100 text-xs line-clamp-2 relative z-10">
                                시간대별, 기상 조건별, 도로 형태별 교통사고 통계 데이터를 다각도로 분석하여 안전 대책을 제안.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Card Body -->
                        <div class="p-6">
                            <div class="space-y-3 mb-6">
                                <div class="flex items-start text-xs text-slate-600">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i>
                                    <span><strong>분석 대상:</strong> 최근 3개년 도로 교통사고 발생 건수 및 유형</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex items-start text-xs text-slate-600">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i>
                                    <span><strong>주요 인사이트:</strong> 특정 위험 요인 파악 및 안전 취약구역 패턴 도출</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex items-start text-xs text-slate-600">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 mr-2"></i>
                                    <span><strong>활용 도구:</strong> 공공데이터포털 API, 통계 시각화</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Card Footer Link Button -->
                    <div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-0">
                        <a href="./data2/index.html" class="w-full bg-slate-100 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-slate-700 hover:text-white font-medium py-3 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm transition duration-300 flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 group-hover:bg-emerald-600 group-hover:text-white">
                            <span>자세히 보기</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-xs"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Additional Activities Section -->
    <section id="activities" class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-xs font-extrabold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Activities</h2>
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">활동 및 경험</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">지후의 데이터 분석 및 학업 활동 기록입니다.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Timeline -->
            <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto border-l-2 border-slate-200 pl-6 sm:pl-8 space-y-10">
                <!-- Activity Item 1 -->
                <div class="relative group">
                    <div class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-blue-600 border-4 border-white shadow"></div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-1">
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">2026.02</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">개인 프로젝트</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">대학알리미 데이터 활용 진로 보고서 완성</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">전국 주요 대학 공시 데이터 분석을 통해 계열별 취업률 및 경쟁률 관계성 도출.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Activity Item 2 -->
                <div class="relative group">
                    <div class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 border-4 border-white shadow"></div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-1">
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">2026.01</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">개인 프로젝트</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">도로교통공단 교통사고 통계 데이터 탐구</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">사고 취약 시간대 및 도로 조건 데이터 분석 및 개선안 작성.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Activity Item 3 -->
                <div class="relative group">
                    <div class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-slate-300 border-4 border-white"></div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-1">
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">2025.09 - 2025.12</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">학업 탐구</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">공공데이터 정제 및 통계 기본 과정 이수</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">데이터 수집, 결측치 처리, 데이터 시각화 라이브러리 기초 습득.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact Section -->
    <section id="contact" class="py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white">
